#: ../../content/applications/general/iot/devices/printer.rst:270
msgid "After checking Epson's website for compatibility with both the `GS v 0 <https://download4.epson.biz/sec_pubs/pos/reference_en/escpos/gs_lv_0.html>`_ and `ESC * <https://download4.epson.biz/sec_pubs/pos/reference_en/escpos/esc_asterisk.html>`_ commands, the TM-U220B printer is indeed incompatible with `GS v 0` but supports `ESC *`."
msgstr "Miután ellenőrizte az Epson weboldalán a `GS v 0 <https://download4.epson.biz/sec_pubs/pos/reference_en/escpos/gs_lv_0.html>`_ és `ESC * <https://download4.epson.biz/sec_pubs/pos/reference_en/escpos/esc_asterisk.html>`_ parancsokkal való kompatibilitást, a TM-U220B nyomtató valóban nem kompatibilis a `GS v 0`-val, de támogatja az `ESC *`-t."

